subproblem.statement:
Let n, l >= 0, U, U' any subsets of R^(n+l), V a contract rectifiable n-varifold in U, V' one in U', and zeta in R^(n+l). Assume:
- V'.weight is the push-forward of V.weight under tau(x) = x - zeta;
- V'.mult x = V.mult(zeta + x) for all x;
- V'.tangentProj x = V.tangentProj(zeta + x) for all x.
Then:
(R1) V'.weight(B_s(0)) = V.weight(B_s(zeta)) for every real s (closed balls);
(R2) V'.tiltExcess 0 s T = V.tiltExcess zeta s T for every s and every subspace T;
(R3) V'.scaledLpNorm (x -> H(zeta + x)) p 0 s = V.scaledLpNorm H p zeta s for every H, p and s;
(R4) if 1 <= V.mult holds V.weight-a.e., then 1 <= V'.mult holds V'.weight-a.e.
